ime                            | Notes                                                                                                                     |\n| ------------------ | --------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Docs clean install | `npm --prefix apps/docs ci` exit 0, 10s | `(cd apps/docs && bun install)` exit 0, 2s | Bun migrated docs package-lock; exact direct versions matched. These are single warm-cache measurements, not a benchmark. |"],[155,"| Step               | npm result/time     | Bun result/time          | Notes                                                                                                                                            |\n| ------------------ | ------------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Root clean install | `npm ci` exit 0, 4s | `bun install` exit 0, 1s | Bun said `migrated lockfile from package-lock.json`; installed listed versions exactly matching root npm resolution. `bun.lock` created as text. |"],[168,"| Step               | npm result/time | Bun result/time                                                                          | Notes                 |\n| ------------------ | --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| Bun sample fixture | n/a             | `bun tools/fixtures/make-capture-bundle.mjs --sample /tmp/t.bikecapture.zip` exit 0, <1s | Wrote a 52 KB bundle. |"],[164,"| Step               | npm result/time | Bun result/time | Notes                                                                      |\n| ------------------ | --------------- | --------------- | ------------------------