          | Notes                                                           |\n| ------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Docs versions | `npm --prefix apps/docs ls --all --json`: exit 0, <1s | `(cd apps/docs && bun pm ls --all)`: exit 0, <1s | next 16.4.3 and typescript 7.0.2 in both; web-only keys absent. |"],[157,"| Step          | npm result/time                    | Bun result/time                | Notes                                                                                                                          |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Root versions | `npm ls --all --json`: exit 0, <1s | `bun pm ls --all`: exit 0, <1s | three 0.186.1; vite 8.3.5; vitest 5.0.5; @playwright/test 1.63.0; typescript 7.0.2 in both. `next` absent in root as expected. |"],[543,"| Topic                      | Claude draft | Codex draft                 | Settled                                                                                                     |\n| -------------------------- | ------------ | --------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Messages show viewed areas | yes          | avoid person-level tracking | No (reversed after the red-team: a checkbox does not make it safe or clear). Per-bike aggregate counts only |"],[539,"| Topic                   | Claude draft        | Codex draft                                | Settled                                                                                                                               |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------- | -------------------